"Display Groups" = "显示组";
"Apps" = "应用程序";
"Menu" = "菜单";
"Keyboard" = "键盘";
"Pro" = "专业版";
"About" = "关于";
"Show help" = "显示帮助";
"App Menu" = "应用程序菜单";
"Guide" = "指南";
"Overview" = "概览";
"Show currently detached (previously disconnected) displays" = "在“设置 > 显示器”中显示当前脱机（过去已断开）显示器";
"Lists every display this app has seen before, so its settings can be edited while it is offline." = "列出本应用见过的所有显示器，脱机时也能修改部分配置。";
"Advanced display settings" = "高级显示设置";
"EDID overrides and custom timing are not implemented in this build." = "EDID 覆盖与自定义时序尚未在本版本实现。";
"Advanced…" = "高级…";
"Virtual screens" = "虚拟屏幕";
"Virtual screens behave like real displays but live in memory. They can be mirrored, streamed or captured." = "虚拟屏幕与真实显示器类似，但只存在于内存中。它可以被镜像、串流或捕获。";
"New Virtual Screen…" = "新建虚拟屏幕…";
"Advanced virtual screen settings" = "高级虚拟屏幕设置";
"Resolution, HiDPI scale and rotation of the virtual screen's framebuffer." = "虚拟屏幕帧缓冲的分辨率、HiDPI 缩放与旋转。";
"Enable connect and disconnect options for displays" = "为显示器启用连接与断开选项";
"Adds the connect switch to each display's header and a Disconnect row to its menu. Disconnecting puts the display to sleep and removes it from the layout." = "在每块显示器的标题栏加上连接开关、菜单里加上断开行。断开会让显示器进入睡眠并从布局中移除。";
"Software XDR/HDR brightness boost and dimming" = "软件 XDR/HDR 亮度提升和调光";
"Uses color table adjustments to push brightness past the panel's backlight. Off by default: it is a tone-map change, not more light." = "用色彩表调整把亮度推到面板背光之上。默认关闭：那是色调映射，不是真的更亮。";
"Allow color table adjustments" = "允许色表调整（兼容模式下需要关闭此选项）";
"Color table control applies colour-related image adjustments and software XDR efficiently. Overlays are used when it is unavailable." = "色表调整可高效应用颜色相关的图像调整与软件 XDR；不可用时改用叠加层。";
"Allow color table adjustments with custom color profiles" = "当显示器使用自定义颜色描述文件时允许色表调整";
"A custom color profile plus color table control can produce a black screen. With this off, color table control is disabled whenever any display uses one." = "自定义颜色描述文件叠加色表调整可能导致黑屏。关闭此项后，只要有显示器使用自定义描述文件，色表调整就整体禁用。";
"Mode %@ at %.0f Hz" = "模式 %@ @ %.0f Hz";
"Change…" = "更改…";
"Switches to the HiDPI twin of the current size: same layout, twice the pixels, no output timing change." = "切到当前尺寸的 HiDPI 配对模式：布局不变、像素翻倍、输出时序不变。";
"Moves the menu bar to this display by translating the whole arrangement so it sits at the origin." = "把整个排列平移到该显示器落在原点，从而把菜单栏移过来。";
"The built-in panel cannot be disconnected." = "内建屏不能断开。";
"Currently %@" = "当前 %@";
"Re-query" = "重新查询";
"No groups yet. The display layer can mirror and arrange displays; group synchronisation is the next layer on top of it." = "还没有显示组。显示层已经能镜像与排列；组同步是叠在它上面的一层。";
"Nothing configured. App rules need the display layer's mode API, which exists; the rule editor does not." = "尚未配置。应用规则所需的显示层接口已经存在，规则编辑器还没有。";
"Choose what the app menu and its display rows contain." = "选择应用程序菜单及其显示器行里包含哪些内容。";
"Use native brightness keys for brightness control" = "使用原生亮度键进行亮度控制";
"Lets the app consume the Apple brightness keys so they can drive external displays, XDR boost and extra dimming as well." = "让本应用接管 Apple 亮度键，从而也能控制外接显示器亮度、XDR 提升与额外调光。";
"Accessibility is granted — the key tap is installed." = "已获得辅助功能权限 —— 键盘事件监听已安装。";
"Accessibility is not granted — the keys keep their system behaviour." = "未获得辅助功能权限 —— 这些键仍走系统行为。";
"Open Privacy…" = "打开隐私设置…";
"Listen for native volume keys" = "监听原生音量键";
"Uses the Apple audio keys to drive the selected display's volume instead of the current output device." = "让 Apple 音量键控制所选显示器的音量，而不是当前输出设备。";
"On-screen display for adjustments" = "调整时显示浮窗 (OSD)";
"Shows the OSD while changing brightness, volume or mute with the keyboard." = "用键盘调整亮度、音量或静音时显示浮窗。";
